    "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Decide the battle with a single deadly strike!<br>One hit, and both you and your enemy will fall\u2014this is a simple yet challenging high-difficulty action game.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>[Game Features]</strong><br>A moment of hesitation can be fatal. Stay on edge until the final blow and experience intense, nerve-wracking combat.<br>The key to victory is finding an opening. However, you only have 10 seconds to defeat each enemy.<br>There\u2019s no time to sit back and observe\u2014read their movements and strike with precision!<br><br>Don\u2019t give up if you fall! Learn enemy patterns little by little and keep challenging yourself.<br>Face off against 20 formidable enemies\u2014defeat them all and aim for the highest rating!</p>",
    "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Decide the battle with a single deadly strike!<br>One hit, and both you and your enemy will fall\u2014this is a simple yet challenging high-difficulty action game.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>[Game Features]</strong><br>A moment of hesitation can be fatal. Stay on edge until the final blow and experience intense, nerve-wracking combat.<br>The key to victory is finding an opening. However, you only have 10 seconds to defeat each enemy.<br>There\u2019s no time to sit back and observe\u2014read their movements and strike with precision!<br><br>Don\u2019t give up if you fall! Learn enemy patterns little by little and keep challenging yourself.<br>Face off against 20 formidable enemies\u2014defeat them all and aim for the highest rating!</p>",
    "short_description": "Decide the battle with a single deadly strike! If you take a hit, both you and your enemy will fall in one blow\u2014 a simple yet challenging high-difficulty action game. Within a limited 10-second window, read your opponent's movements, find an opening, and strike them down instantly!",
